    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Overview]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;CUPLEX&quot; is a time-shift action puzzle game where you cooperate with &quot;your past self&quot; to reach the goal. With each turn, your &quot;past self&quot; multiplies. <br>You will utilize them effectively to solve complex and orderly puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Story]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the new virtual space, &quot;CUPLEX&quot;. This is a virtual space , where unlike traditional ones, all senses... including sight, hearing, smell, taste, and touch, are interconnected. The protagonist, &quot;Cube&quot; hacked into the &quot;Library&quot; within CUPLEX in search of specific information. As he progresses through the Library, the truth behind CUPLEX gradually unfolds. Will he be able to accomplish his mission in the end...? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Features]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbA unique puzzle system utilizing &quot;time-shift action&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbA relaxed atmosphere with calming music and graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbNumerous gimmicks and a total of 36 stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbMore than 10 hidden Items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbA ranking system in order to compete with players around the world</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Overview]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;CUPLEX&quot; is a time-shift action puzzle game where you cooperate with &quot;your past self&quot; to reach the goal. With each turn, your &quot;past self&quot; multiplies. <br>You will utilize them effectively to solve complex and orderly puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Story]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the new virtual space, &quot;CUPLEX&quot;. This is a virtual space , where unlike traditional ones, all senses... including sight, hearing, smell, taste, and touch, are interconnected. The protagonist, &quot;Cube&quot; hacked into the &quot;Library&quot; within CUPLEX in search of specific information. As he progresses through the Library, the truth behind CUPLEX gradually unfolds. Will he be able to accomplish his mission in the end...? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Features]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbA unique puzzle system utilizing &quot;time-shift action&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbA relaxed atmosphere with calming music and graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbNumerous gimmicks and a total of 36 stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbMore than 10 hidden Items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbA ranking system in order to compete with players around the world</p>",
